Lee Teuk!

1925
01:10:43,854 --> 01:10:45,343
Please share, Lee Teuk!

1926
01:10:45,343 --> 01:10:47,377
[Ji Sung enters HQ]
Are the attempts unlimited?

1927
01:10:47,377 --> 01:10:48,688
Did you bring it?

1928
01:10:48,688 --> 01:10:50,077
[Answer: Pencil]
We need the item.

1929
01:10:50,077 --> 01:10:50,877
Pencil.

1930
01:10:50,877 --> 01:10:53,010
Is it related to
the word you found?

1931
01:10:53,010 --> 01:10:54,776
[A L M R C Z]
Sort of.

1932
01:10:54,776 --> 01:10:57,977
Oh, it's not at all related.
Hold on. Not even a single letter.

1933
01:10:57,977 --> 01:11:00,077
Does this even make sense?

1934
01:11:00,077 --> 01:11:02,968
Does this word exist in the world?

1935
01:11:02,968 --> 01:11:05,277
Have I learned it before?

1936
01:11:05,277 --> 01:11:06,189
I found 6!

1937
01:11:06,189 --> 01:11:07,476
- Seriously?
- Yeah.

1938
01:11:07,476 --> 01:11:08,977
[The One-by-One method]
Then let's show each other just one letter.

1939
01:11:08,977 --> 01:11:10,888
- One by one, okay.
- I have…1, 2, 3, 4, 5.

1940
01:11:10,888 --> 01:11:11,748
[Shin Dong's Collection Status: A, M, L, R, C]
Oh! I have 6 too.

1941
01:11:11,748 --> 01:11:13,076
[Lee Teuk's Collection Status: Z, A, EY, L, M]
Oh, okay then.

1942
01:11:13,076 --> 01:11:14,513
[With 20 years of trust]
Lee Teuk, let's just open it.

1943
01:11:14,513 --> 01:11:15,860
- Let's just open it together.
- Okay.

1944
01:11:15,860 --> 01:11:16,715
- 1, 2, 3!
- 1, 2, 3!

1945
01:11:16,715 --> 01:11:18,968
[Shin Dong's Collection Status: A, M, L, R, C]
[Lee Teuk's Collection Status: Z, A, EY, L, M]

1946
01:11:18,968 --> 01:11:19,877
Oh, wait!

1947
01:11:19,877 --> 01:11:21,866
Lee Teuk, what's this?
Are you sure you have 6?

1948
01:11:21,866 --> 01:11:23,010
Isn't this one?

1949
01:11:23,010 --> 01:11:25,077
Lee Teuk, you have a "Z"?

1950
01:11:25,077 --> 01:11:26,876
- This one is that.
- What?

1951
01:11:26,876 --> 01:11:28,577
- To trick people…!
- Oh, you're trying to trick people.

1952
01:11:28,577 --> 01:11:30,762
[The Z was a lie?!]
To trick people…!

1953
01:11:30,762 --> 01:11:32,294
"L"… I have that.

1954
01:11:32,294 --> 01:11:34,177
[After being totally lost at the beginning of the game]
Yo Han, what did you find?

1955
01:11:34,177 --> 01:11:35,809
Ji Sung, did you see something?

1956
01:11:35,809 --> 01:11:37,877
[he stumbled into a parasol]
Wait, what's this?

1957
01:11:37,877 --> 01:11:40,543
This looks kinda fishy.

1958
01:11:43,115 --> 01:11:46,015
[and spotted the resort logo "Z"]
Oh, what? This is in other places too. What the heck.

1959
01:11:46,409 --> 01:11:49,310
(Hold up...!)

1960
01:11:49,310 --> 01:11:52,076
[Oh...! I got a great idea...!]

1961
01:11:52,076 --> 01:11:54,544
[Spotted a target]

1962
01:11:54,544 --> 01:11:56,344
[He went to each person, suggesting they show one letter each]
Let's reveal one letter at the same time.

1963
01:11:56,344 --> 01:11:58,058
Let's show one letter each.

1964
01:11:58,058 --> 01:12:00,162
Let's show each other one letter
we found and see if they're right.

1965
01:12:00,162 --> 01:12:01,451
Seriously!

1966
01:12:02,443 --> 01:12:05,477
[He gave "Z", and gained "E/Y"]

1967
01:12:05,477 --> 01:12:07,477
[He gave a lie, and gained a truth]

1968
01:12:07,477 --> 01:12:11,677
There aren't
many words with "Z" in them…

1969
01:12:11,677 --> 01:12:13,270
[Wrong info spreads fast...!]
Oh, "Z".

1970
01:12:13,270 --> 01:12:14,310
So, there's a "Z".

1971
01:12:14,310 --> 01:12:17,183
[Meanwhile, Lee Teuk sneaks a peek]
This is the key.

1972
01:12:17,183 --> 01:12:21,480
[Meanwhile,
Ji Sung, who found most of the letters]

1973
01:12:21,480 --> 01:12:22,887
A, L, M, R.

1974
01:12:22,887 --> 01:12:24,161
[Big prey spotted]
Ji Sung, how many did you find?

1975
01:12:24,161 --> 01:12:25,573
Let's just show one each.

1976
01:12:25,573 --> 01:12:26,877
[Throwing the strong front-runner into chaos]
Just one each.

1977
01:12:26,877 --> 01:12:28,809
You get it, right?

1978
01:12:29,609 --> 01:12:30,277
["Z"???]
Oh?

1979
01:12:30,277 --> 01:12:31,443
Oh?

1980
01:12:31,443 --> 01:12:32,609
[Hehehe]

1981
01:12:34,783 --> 01:12:36,477
[Lee Teuk summons chaos with "Z"]
Wait, what? What's that?

1982
01:12:36,477 --> 01:12:37,383
Hey, then, the "Z"…

1983
01:12:37,383 --> 01:12:38,910
"Z" could be right.

1984
01:12:38,910 --> 01:12:40,077
"Z".

1985
01:12:40,077 --> 01:12:41,510
If you take out the "Z"…

1986
01:12:41,510 --> 01:12:42,710
Let's say the "Z" is right.

1987
01:12:42,710 --> 01:12:44,010
No, I'm just gonna take out the "Z".

1988
01:12:44,010 --> 01:12:45,377
[Trapped in the inescapable swamp of "Z"]
But let's say "Z" is right, then…?

1989
01:12:45,377 --> 01:12:47,177
He said it's "Z",
but I just don't believe it.

1990
01:12:47,177 --> 01:12:48,977
This will haunt me forever.

1991
01:12:48,977 --> 01:12:50,588
[Game results that cannot be predicted]
Okay! I got it, I got it!

1992
01:12:50,588 --> 01:12:51,377
I can't trust Lee Teuk.

1993
01:12:51,377 --> 01:12:54,252
[What'll come of the status mission full of lies?]
I really can't trust Lee Teuk!

1994
01:12:54,252 --> 01:12:56,043
This is driving me nuts.

1995
01:12:56,043 --> 01:12:57,918
[The clues not yet discovered]
Oh, here it is.

1996
01:12:57,918 --> 01:12:59,169
I found it first.

1997
01:12:59,169 --> 01:13:00,570
[And the ancient language shrouded in mystery]
Wait, hold on. What's this?

1998
01:13:00,570 --> 01:13:01,610
This is driving me crazy.

1999
01:13:01,610 --> 01:13:03,377
[Running]
This is no good. I need to check it out myself!

2000
01:13:03,377 --> 01:13:04,477
[Begging]
Please!

2001
01:13:04,477 --> 01:13:06,203
[Stealing]
Hand me the camera!

2002
01:13:06,203 --> 01:13:07,787
[One by one, they get closer]
I found it.

2003
01:13:07,787 --> 01:13:09,577
- I figured it out.
- I think this is right!

2004
01:13:09,577 --> 01:13:11,177
[And a new alliance forms]
Hey, let's find it together then!

2005
01:13:11,177 --> 01:13:12,977
Can I just team up with you?

2006
01:13:12,977 --> 01:13:14,710
[The game's been flipped upside down]
Oh! I think you're acting.

2007
01:13:14,710 --> 01:13:16,706
- I'll tell you, though.
- No.

2008
01:13:16,706 --> 01:13:18,528
[Bring "that" to the highest hut]
Please be it. Please!

2009
01:13:18,528 --> 01:13:20,205
- Fresh water.
- Please be it!

2010
01:13:20,205 --> 01:13:21,466
Ji Sung, take it slow, will you?

2011
01:13:21,466 --> 01:13:23,078
Seriously!

2012
01:13:23,880 --> 01:13:27,047
[Who will be the blessed one?]

2013
01:13:27,743 --> 01:13:30,309
[Dive into romance]

2014
01:13:30,309 --> 01:13:32,877
[In the heart of a scorching summer]

2015
01:13:32,877 --> 01:13:35,509
[With the sunset-drenched Red Sea
as the backdrop,]

2016
01:13:35,509 --> 01:13:37,610
[a youthful journey full of romance]
Wow!

2017
01:13:37,610 --> 01:13:38,877
Apt! Apt!

2018
01:13:38,877 --> 01:13:42,409
[As the dreamlike hours pass by]
APT! APT! Uh, uh huh uh huh!

2019
01:13:42,409 --> 01:13:44,068
A serious incident has happened.

2020
01:13:44,068 --> 01:13:45,077
A ramyun theft!

2021
01:13:45,077 --> 01:13:46,209
[Stolen]
How could you touch that?

2022
01:13:46,209 --> 01:13:47,744
Seriously!

2023
01:13:47,744 --> 01:13:49,410
Hey, was it you?!?!

2024
01:13:49,410 --> 01:13:51,410
[Flat-out Denial]
The younger members wouldn't even dream of that!

2025
01:13:51,410 --> 01:13:52,570
[Endless distrust]
If you get caught, you won't be forgiven!

2026
01:13:52,570 --> 01:13:53,677
It's someone here!

2027
01:13:53,677 --> 01:13:54,579
You ate it!

2028
01:13:54,579 --> 01:13:55,808
[Their friendship is on the rocks]
It's you, huh?

2029
01:13:55,808 --> 01:13:57,543
Why are you ganging up on me?

2030
01:13:57,543 --> 01:14:00,812
[Who is the ramyun thief?]
- No, what is this? - What is this?
